cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this was useful in your work, please cite it."
title: "docxaudit: find what your converter silently dropped from a .docx"
abstract: "Reads the raw OOXML of a Word document and reports the conversion failures that ship unnoticed: a table collapsed to zero width, an orphaned image, a supplement whose page count no longer matches the PDF. Exits non-zero, so it drops into a manuscript pipeline."
type: software
authors:
